  <x:String x:Key="DuplicatesOverviewAccessibleName">Duplicate groups</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="DuplicatesIntro">Duplicates are versions of the same content. No file is deleted, hidden or moved; you only choose which one plays by default.</x:String>
