  <x:String x:Key="RestoreRootsEmptyTitle">Nothing to remap</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="RestoreRootsEmptyDescription">Every folder in the archive exists on this machine.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="RestorePreservesDatabaseNotice">The database being replaced is renamed, not deleted. If the restore turns out wrong, the file you had is still there.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="RestoreUnresolvedRootWarning">Point this root somewhere before confirming, or its titles restore as unavailable.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="RestoreArtworkNotIncludedNotice">The artwork cache is not in the archive and is not restored. It rebuilds on its own.</x:String>
