  <x:String x:Key="SegmentDetectionSettingsTitle">Automatic segment detection</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="SegmentDetectionSettingsDescription">Compares the episodes of each series locally to find recurring intros, recaps, and credits. Nothing is sent anywhere, playback always comes first, and every detection can be reviewed or corrected.</x:String>
